WEBVTT

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:05.850
In order to enter the Junior Youth Championship, 
which is the first step to become a pro,

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.750
Yuya has to win four consecutive matches.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.350
The difficulty makes me shiver!

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.890
The ex-champion Strong 
Ishijima's manager Nico Smiley

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:20.410
will find Yuya's four opponents.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.730
All right!  This is perfect!

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.550
Starting tomorrow, I'll use 
this deck to win four matches.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.640
I'll take my first step to become a pro.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.680
I see it.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.990
I see that Pendulum Summon 
can evolve even further.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.480
I won't lose to him either.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:54.230
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:59.130
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:02.410
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.410
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:25.190
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.600
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.340
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:41.910
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:44.110
Impulse  Got it got it

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:49.320
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:00.080
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:07.000
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.940
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.340
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:24.620
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:27.960
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:38.000
Genius Cook Michio Mokota

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.580
Good morning, En.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.430
Core, Watt and Kilo.

00:02:55.430 --> 00:02:58.120
Huh?  There are two more?

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.870
Mom picked up more strays.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:04.850
Yuya!

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.030
Good morning.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.230
Good morning.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.540
You've made yourself completely at home.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:14.560
It's fine because we're friends, Yuya.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.470
Good luck in your four 
matches that start today.

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:21.960
I'm trying to enter the championship 
because I want to enter with you.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:26.500
You're also dueling today 
for the right to enter?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:30.870
Yeah.  Since I only have to win six 
matches in a row, it'll be easy.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:33.210
You...

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.830
Mom, is breakfast ready?

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.470
Wait just a little longer.

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:42.270
I'm making mille-feuille pork 
cutlets and special salad.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:47.140
Instead of something that elaborate, 
I prefer the usual pancakes.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:51.160
But this is Michy's recipe.  
He's popular among housewives.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.850
I'm fine with anything, so hurry up!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:56.120
I said wait!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.800
If you don't hurry, I'll 
be late for the duel!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.220
Ahh!  You made me mess up!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:10.250
I had to leave without eating breakfast.

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:12.940
What's this smell?

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.970
It smells really delicious!

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.960
It's from here.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:25.520
Kirigakure Cooking School.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:31.720
I was told to come here.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:34.700
I've been waiting for you, Yuya.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:37.470
Go inside.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:41.120
But this is a cooking school.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.560
It's fine.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.850
Smells delicious!

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.050
Michy Love?

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.670
What's that?

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:08.960
Let me introduce today's opponent Michy.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:12.010
Michio Mokota!

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.430
So you're Yuya Sakaki.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:25.640
Michio is a young cook who 
has created his own recipes.

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:30.610
He's very popular with housewives who 
have trouble creating their daily menus.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.500
It seems you're very hungry.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:41.470
I didn't get to eat breakfast, and since 
everyone is cooking, it smells delicious.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:48.700
Since you're starving, I'll serve you up 
with a Cooking Duel based on my perfect recipes.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.330
Principal Kirigakure!

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.900
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:58.100
Michio has already qualified for 
the Junior Youth Championship,

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.590
so why is he having another official match?

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.240
Like I explained before-

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:04.840
It's fine, Mama.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:10.130
Yuya Sakaki defeated Strong Ishijjima.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:14.700
This seems fun, so I'll serve him up.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:16.990
You're right.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:19.530
This will be easy for you.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:24.100
Show him your skills that 
rival LDS's top class.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:25.810
Leave it to me, Mama.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:29.190
Mama will cheer you on, so good luck.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.100
Yuya!

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.470
You came?

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:36.930
Of course!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:41.270
Today's duel is your first 
step in becoming a pro.

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:44.470
Win and make me shiver!

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:51.810
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:56.190
It's time for the match between 
Pendulum Summon pioneer Yuya Sakaki

00:06:56.920 --> 00:07:02.170
and the Prince of Cooking 
Duels Michio Mokota!

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:05.130
Intoxicate me with your recipes!

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.780
Dear, are you watching?

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:17.360
Michio is having a match,

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:20.410
but you can't come to the arena 
because you're preparing your meals?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:24.520
Take it away, Principal Kirigakure!

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:31.240
Cooking is an endless quest of possibilities.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.100
That is the same with dueling.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:36.400
These two have bright futures,

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:41.610
and I'll have them battle on a 
field most fit for a Cooking Duel!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.980
Action Field on!

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:53.160
I activate the Field Spell Chaos Kitchen!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.300
We're in a kitchen?

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.300
That's right.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:02.530
So that I can serve you up!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:07.670
No matter the field, I'll keep 
doing my entertainment dueling!

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:12.370
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:13.950
Along with their monsters,

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:17.980
they'll kick the ground and fly through 
the sky to move around the field!

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:22.180
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.350
Action!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.130
Duel!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.020
Freshness is important in 
both cooking and dueling.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.500
I'll go first.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:38.130
I'll make you taste the 
greatness of my Cooking Duel!

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:42.190
I summon Cookpal Cluckwheat from my hand!

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.330
Let's go, Cluckwheat!

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.860
I'm taking an Action Card!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.990
An Action Card already?

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.980
I got a good one.

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:17.840
I'll use it before it loses its freshness.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:21.100
I activate the Action 
Spell Monster Microwave!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:26.160
I return one monster on my field to my hand

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:30.150
to Special Summon a Level 
4-or-below monster from my hand.

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:37.070
I return Cluckwheat to my hand to 
Special Summon Level 1 Cookpal Eggong!

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:41.410
Cluckwheat's effect activates.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:45.930
When this card returns from my field to my 
hand, I can Special Summon it this turn!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:53.020
When there are at least 
two Cookpals on my field,

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:57.070
I can Special Summon Cookpal 
Pumapotato from my hand!

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.100
Furthermore...

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:11.700
That's...

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:16.270
I got another Action Card.

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:18.840
He already has three monsters.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.210
And an Action Card.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:26.640
He doesn't look tough, 
but he's pretty strong.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.610
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:35.300
Michio has started out strong.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:38.820
Because he has mastered this field.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:41.790
First, he gathers his ingredients.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:42.930
That's right.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:45.990
Michio hasn't shown his true skills yet.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.360
My turn!

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.840
This is the end!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.560
I've lost!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.270
Let's go to the next match.

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.160
Right.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.840
My turn!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:20.040
C'mon, Yuya!

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.900
Sheesh.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:25.030
You can't help it because 
you didn't eat breakfast,

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:28.070
but don't use that as 
an excuse when you lose.

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.990
Why am I going to lose?

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:34.240
Because my recipes are perfect.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:39.210
I used them to create my Cooking 
Duel, so there's no way you can win.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.950
You can't know the outcome 
until you play it out!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:45.580
I summon Performapal Whip Snake from my hand!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.870
Whip Snake, let's go!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.810
Watch out!

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.040
I found one!

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:15.500
He's doing pretty well.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:21.390
Yuya is the son of Action 
Duel pioneer Yusyo Sakaki.

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:25.020
That's why you have high hopes for him.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:30.360
Let's battle!  Whip Snake attacks Eggong!

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:38.190
I activate the Action Spell Freeze Freezer!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.110
That's the Action Spell you just got!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:45.760
Freeze Freezer negates all your 
monsters' attacks this turn.

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:50.750
I feel tied up.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:55.250
I'll also activate an Action 
Spell!  Battle Burner!

00:12:55.640 --> 00:13:00.500
When a monster's attack is negated, 
it's allowed to attack again!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.530
And the attack can't be negated this time!

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:07.400
Whip Snake, attack again!

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.670
He did it!

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:19.400
Due to Battle Burner's effect, if the 
attacking monster destroys your monster,

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.610
all monsters on your field in 
attack position are destroyed!

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:30.130
It's a clean sweep of his monsters!

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:32.480
That gives me shivers!

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:34.330
I end my turn!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.300
You can't know the outcome of 
a duel until you play it out!

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:41.930
Actually, I do know the outcome.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:45.390
It's following my recipe perfectly!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:49.330
I activate the Continuous Trap Food Cemetery!

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:51.840
When this card activates,

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:56.680
all Cookpals that were sent to the graveyard 
this turn are sent to Food Cemetery.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.760
The destroyed monsters were placed inside!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:12.360
For every card that was stored away, I 
add one Cookpal in my deck to my hand.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:18.840
The more monsters that were sent to the 
graveyard, the stronger Food Cemetery became.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.240
Since you destroyed all my monsters for me,

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:25.760
you saved me the trouble of 
having to do it on my own.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:30.040
I placed an order for more Cookpals!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:32.580
Nice, Michio.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.900
He added three monsters to his hand.

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.860
The preparations are complete.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:46.360
The preparations are complete.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:51.730
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:57.470
Since you're starving, I'll 
serve you my special meal.

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:00.530
Michy is serving his special meal!

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:03.930
I activate Regal Recipes from my hand.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:10.620
For every card in my Food Cemetery,

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:14.870
I can Special Summon a Royal 
Cookpal in attack position!

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:20.330
There are currently three 
cards inside Food Cemetery.

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.540
Here's the order!

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:33.680
I Special Summon Knight Pasta, 
Princess Pudding and Prince Curry!

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:48.160
He Special Summoned a top-class monster 
for every monster inside Food Cemetery.

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.620
They look delicious-

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:51.670
Oops, I mean...

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:53.500
They look tough.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:57.950
On the turn that Food Cemetery activates,

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.470
destroyed Cookpals are stored 
inside Food Cemetery.

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.910
And due to Regal Recipes,

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:08.410
I can Special Summon a Royal Cookpal 
for every Cookpal that was stored away.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:13.150
So even if I destroy his monsters,

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.990
his combo brings out a more 
powerful monster for each one.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:20.960
Exactly!  This is my perfect recipe!

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.960
I got an Action Card.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.170
He got another Action Card!

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:33.470
I activate Regal Recipes's additional 
effect before my food gets cold!

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:40.910
You take 300 points of damage for every 
monster that this card Special Summoned!

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.640
He Special Summoned three Royal Cookpals.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.640
300 times 3...

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.810
900 points of damage!

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:54.190
Please pay for the meal 
with your life points!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:05.810
He brought out a lot of food, but they 
only have 300 attack points each!

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:08.500
You can't destroy my Whip Snake!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.330
Maybe for now.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:15.960
But my perfect recipe 
strengthens my Royal Cookpals.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:16.880
What?

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.750
Princess Pudding's effect activates.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:27.440
Once per turn, this monster doubles 
my Royal Cookpal's attack points.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:30.500
That's Michy's prix fixe menu!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:35.100
Yeah!  Since it comes with 
dessert, it doubles the joy!

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:40.010
But when Princess Pudding uses this 
effect, she can't attack this turn.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:43.730
Next, I activate Knight Pasta's effect!

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:51.050
This monster also doubles my Royal 
Cookpal's attack points once per turn!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:54.080
A curry and pasta combo!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.360
There's so much food that I 
feel like I'm getting a deal!

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:02.560
But when Knight Pasta uses this 
effect, he can't attack this turn.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:09.100
You two!  How can you be drooling when 
the opponent is getting stronger?

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:13.930
Yuya is dueling with all his might!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.610
Yuya!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:24.240
It seems you enjoy my special menu.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.100
Yeah.  It makes me drool.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:29.640
But no matter how delicious he looks,

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:33.960
Prince Curry has less attack 
points than Whip Snake!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:36.260
That's true.  For now.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:40.800
But what if I change the flavor?

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:44.040
I activate the Action Spell Spicy Spice!

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:49.710
One monster gains 1000 attack 
points during this turn!

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:53.780
Prince Curry, become more delicious!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.480
Let's battle!

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:01.960
Prince Curry attacks Whip Snake!

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:05.190
Excellent Express Curry Plate!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.680
Oh my.  Was is too spicy?

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.740
I end my turn.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:25.880
Spicy Spice, Princess Pudding and 
Knight Pasta's effects now end,

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:29.220
so Prince Curry's attack 
points return to normal.

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.920
Have you had your fill of my Cooking Duel?

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.390
My turn!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:42.560
All right!  It's my time!

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:48.730
As payback, I'll make you 
taste my Pendulum Summon!

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:57.390
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:02.960
Here it comes!

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:04.700
It's time for his counterattack!

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.560
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.480
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.220
Pendulum Summon!

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:15.040
Come out, my monsters!

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:20.730
I'm counting on you, Performapal Trampolynx!

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.960
Performapal Partnaga!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:28.130
And Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.590
Let me welcome your party!

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:39.810
Since you're showing me the 
fabled Pendulum Summon,

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.960
I must show you hospitality.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:43.440
Hospitality?

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:47.300
That's right.  The best hospitality.

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:52.200
When you summon or Special Summon a monster,

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:57.170
Princess Pudding, Knight Pasta and Prince 
Curry's additional effects activate!

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.160
Full Stomachs for Everyone!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:14.840
It's not fair that only you 
get to eat!  I'm starving too!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:19.560
More!  Eat more!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:23.360
Eat all my cooking monsters!

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:24.990
What's with that?

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:27.300
They're force feeding them.  It's horrible!

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.270
Gross!

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:39.270
They ate so much that they 
can't take another bite.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:45.350
By returning Princess Pudding, Knight 
Pasta and Prince Curry to my hand,

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:49.560
one of your monsters is 
destroyed for each card!

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:53.790
No way!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.720
All my monsters are gone.

00:22:12.960 --> 00:22:18.440
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:27.920
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:39.930
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:45.170
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:50.610
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:55.870
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.470
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:05.890
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.180 --> 00:23:11.860
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:17.270
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.270 --> 00:23:22.570
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:22.570 --> 00:23:31.940
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:40.160
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:51.410
I placed an order for Knight Pasta, 
Prince Curry and Princess Pudding!

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:56.330
I know they're powerful monsters, 
but they look delicious!

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:59.120
I can do much more than this.

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:02.720
Since you're starving, I'll 
serve you up with my special!

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:04.020
Is that...

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:05.010
Can it be?

00:24:05.010 --> 00:24:06.290
It's a pork cutlet!

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:11.190
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
 Splendid Spread!!  Full Stomachs for Everyone!

00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:13.390
The fun is only getting started!
